    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake at the edge of a collapsed mine in an abandoned town.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wind doesn't move, something feels wrong.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no choice but to go down.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices crawl along the tunnel walls. Black slime seeps through the seams.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You descend to investigate.... and survive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No weapons.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No defense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only what stalks you in the dark... and the sound of your own breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734620/extras/449b595e18d35bfc00792960b87f0fdb.poster.avif?t=1748894028\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734620/extras/449b595e18d35bfc00792960b87f0fdb.webm?t=1748894028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734620/extras/449b595e18d35bfc00792960b87f0fdb.mp4?t=1748894028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive First-Person Horror \u2013 Explore claustrophobic mine shafts designed for tension, dread, and environmental storytelling.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Terror</strong> \u2013 No jump scare spam. This is slow-burn fear that builds through sound, pacing, and disorientation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools</strong> \u2013 Use your flashlight, movement, and instincts to avoid death. There is no health bar, only survival and death.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore Through Discovery</strong> \u2013 Find miner notes, and visual clues to piece together a buried truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent, reactive enemies that stalk, listen, and hunt with intent.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Callisto Protocol, SOMA, and The Descent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine Of Madness is a solo-developed, story-driven horror descent into what should have stayed buried.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare to go deeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
