gh Discovery</strong> \u2013 Find miner notes, and visual clues to piece together a buried truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent, reactive enemies that stalk, listen, and hunt with intent.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Callisto Protocol, SOMA, and The Descent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine Of Madness is a solo-developed, story-driven horror descent into what should have stayed buried.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare to go deeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
